      "order": 2,
      "text": "[*FOCUS dataset column*](#glossary:FOCUS-dataset-column) MUST be expressed in UTC (Coordinated Universal Time) to avoid ambiguity and ensure consistency across different time zones.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
